flowchart LR
    Dev[Developer edits in Replit] -->|Stage, commit, push| GitHub[GitHub repository]
    GitHub -->|Push/PR to main| CI[ci.yml checks and build validation]
    GitHub -->|Manual workflow_dispatch| DeployWorkflow[deploy.yml]
    DeployWorkflow -->|SSH as existing EC2 user| Sync[Copy repository files to EC2 app directory]
    Sync --> Compose[Run deploy/deploy.sh => docker compose up --build -d]
    Compose --> Web[Frontend Nginx container :8080]
    Compose --> API[Express API container :5000]
    HostNginx[Host Nginx :80/:443] -->|proxy_pass 127.0.0.1:18080| Web
    Web -->|/api/*| API
